{"hymn":"FR35","parent":"E220","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Ta table avec le pain , le vin","subtitle":"","syl":{"n1":"Ta","n2":"table","n4":["a","i"],"n5":["vec","t"],"n7":"le","n8":"pain,","n9":"le","n10":"vin,","n11":"Nous","n12":["con","i"],"n14":["tem","m"],"n15":["plons,","t"],"n16":["Sei","i"],"n17":["gneur.","t"],"n18":"Par","n19":"ces","n21":["sym","i"],"n22":["bo","m"],"n23":["les","t"],"n24":"nous","n26":["voy","i"],"n27":["ons","t"],"n28":"Le","n30":["des","i"],"n31":["sein","t"],"n32":"de","n33":"Ton","n34":"cœur."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Seigneur, Tu es le pain de vie,","Qui descendit des cieux.","Tu fus brisé pour Te donner,","Tu es le pain de Dieu."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["La coupe est la portion de Dieu,","Qui nous est accordée.","Ce sang précieux nous qualifie,","Pour nous L'approprier."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Nous Te mangeons, oh ! Pain de vie !","Nous souvenant de Toi.","En prenant part à Tes richesses,","Nous Te donnons la gloire."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["La coupe de bénédiction","Nous en boirons avec joie.","Nous en boirons jusqu'à ce jour,","Où nous pourrons Te voir."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Prenant part à ce doux festin,","Ta mort nous proclamons","Et témoignons de jour en jour","De Toi, notre portion."]},{"label":"7.","lines":["Nous attendons le grand festin,","Lorsque Tu reviendras.","Nous mangerons, nous festoierons,","Toujours devant Ta face !"]}]}